HDS Data Model: licensing

Copyright (c) 2025-2026, Health Data Safe (https://www.healthdatasafe.org) and contributors

Versions up to and including 4.17.1 were released in their entirety under the
BSD 3-Clause License and remain available under it. From version 4.18.0,
this repository holds two kinds of material, under two licences. Third-party
material (section 3) is covered by neither.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Model content: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Covered, except the third-party material of section 3: everything under
`definitions/` and `documentation/`, the Markdown files at the repository
root, and the published pack built from them (`pack.json` and the other data
files served at https://model.datasafe.dev, converter definitions included):
streams, items, event types, conversions, settings, vocabularies, document
kinds, labels, descriptions and translations.

The JSON Schemas (`src/schemas/`, published under `json-schemas/`) may be used
under either licence, at your choice.

Licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

